# RX Store — PRODUCTION frontend environment (loaded automatically by Vite
# for production builds: `vite build` / `npm run build`).
#
# This file is COMMITTED on purpose: VITE_API_URL is a public API origin (it
# is baked into the client bundle regardless), and having it in the repo makes
# CI/Cloudflare Pages builds deterministic — a build can never silently ship
# without its backend wired in (vite.config.ts enforces this).
#
# Secrets NEVER belong here. Local overrides go in .env.local (gitignored).
VITE_API_URL=https://rx-store-api.calcitoninpay.workers.dev/v1
